purpose: >
  Generate route-aware Open Graph images by inspecting a web codebase
  and rendering assets aligned with existing brand language.
schema_version: 1.0
effective_date: 2026-04-24
triggers:
  - user requests the capability described in this skill
  - user asks for route-specific OG image generation or refresh
inputs:
  - target repo or page set to inspect
  - framework context (Next.js, Astro, React Router, etc.)
  - output preference (static assets, metadata wiring, or both)
  - branding constraints (logo, typography, page-type distinctions)
outputs:
  - generated OG image assets in correct static output location
  - route map covering pages and visual treatments
  - metadata wiring notes when requested
non_goals:
  - metadata-only tasks without image generation
  - illustration or marketing design from scratch
  - replacing metadata patterns wholesale
risks:
  - missing repo context; mitigated by stopping before inventing treatments
  - missing branding assets; mitigated by route discovery before generation
